=== entry ec7234b3df12
kind: translation
rules: team-kit, invoke
intent: `/deslop` loses its plugin name and runs only if installed, named with no slash. Keep the worktree-off-trunk rule and the landable-commits rule.
--- upstream
Work from a git worktree off trunk, and keep unrelated work out of it. Rebase into small, landable commits. Run `/deslop` from `cursor-team-kit` over the diff before commit.
--- patched
Work from a git worktree off trunk, and keep unrelated work out of it. Rebase into small, landable commits. Run the **deslop** skill, if it is installed, over the diff before commit.
